AI Explanation
Instead of simply saying Fraud Detected, the application should generate a narrative such as:
Risk Score: 97 (Critical)
This account initiated 20 consecutive transactions of ₹49,000 within a short time period to multiple beneficiary accounts. The funds were subsequently consolidated into a single account and later transferred through additional intermediary accounts. The same device ID and IP address were observed across several linked accounts, indicating coordinated activity. The overall transaction pattern strongly resembles Structuring followed by Layering, which are common money laundering techniques. Immediate investigation is recommended.

